{
  "html": "<h1 id=\"changelog\"><a href=\"#changelog\">Changelog</a></h1>\n<h2 id=\"132-2026-08-12\"><a href=\"#132-2026-08-12\"><a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/compare/v1.3.1...v1.3.2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">1.3.2</a> (2026-08-12)</a></h2>\n<h3 id=\"other-changes\"><a href=\"#other-changes\">Other Changes</a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>allow rebuildinging image (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/4a6f0a54ac1e3eb727a9bacfa4387e9fdf09cf46\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">4a6f0a5</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"131-2026-07-30\"><a href=\"#131-2026-07-30\"><a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/compare/v1.3.0...v1.3.1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">1.3.1</a> (2026-07-30)</a></h2>\n<h3 id=\"bug-fixes\"><a href=\"#bug-fixes\">Bug Fixes</a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>allow configuring connection attempts (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/c18cb81f8cb2800f9286c7fea35531a44cd44ca1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">c18cb81</a>)</li>\n<li>cli import (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/62313cb8e2278f837785773d98086a90c0d6a01f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">62313cb</a>)</li>\n<li>healthcheck requires all workers (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/8e20c8c7799ca2c21afe2b501d56aafdc4eb69b0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">8e20c8c</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"other-changes-1\"><a href=\"#other-changes-1\">Other Changes</a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>update ruff version (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/828d70c96985e0b4bed9250d7216202dcb9f822c\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">828d70c</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"130-2026-07-14\"><a href=\"#130-2026-07-14\"><a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/compare/v1.2.2...v1.3.0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">1.3.0</a> (2026-07-14)</a></h2>\n<h3 id=\"features\"><a href=\"#features\">Features</a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>element x onboarding (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/b9b39445fbf026e472ef99fb9b6c3264466c7518\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">b9b3944</a>)</li>\n<li>use matrix authentication service (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/446fdfbce44d55e0824ce429709fd521a828a422\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">446fdfb</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"bug-fixes-1\"><a href=\"#bug-fixes-1\">Bug Fixes</a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>devspace (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/e9ae8fb6e9dc2530567c19fdd9d5ee265fc0aa17\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">e9ae8fb</a>)</li>\n<li>implement proper healtcheck (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/191b3429031b05be17a8ced59a0ce5d1a1f461c0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">191b342</a>)</li>\n<li>naming + pylint (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/65ef839b8765f62a4fb580eddf8d717c2dfb6317\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">65ef839</a>)</li>\n<li>remove kc registration (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/77ef01da8431f98d4f2668d6a090883b7d612e93\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">77ef01d</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"122-2026-07-02\"><a href=\"#122-2026-07-02\"><a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/compare/v1.2.1...v1.2.2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">1.2.2</a> (2026-07-02)</a></h2>\n<h3 id=\"bug-fixes-2\"><a href=\"#bug-fixes-2\">Bug Fixes</a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>release-please changelog (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/81296442db6b8edfcb6da0f2645bff89354072c4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">8129644</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"other-changes-2\"><a href=\"#other-changes-2\">Other Changes</a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>pin version and use new name for helper scripts (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/d5d15eeccbb76fbc74a4fc09ebe99d04c175e90d\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">d5d15ee</a>)</li>\n<li>upgrade lockfile versions (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/40f7f5c14b65e694846da329660ef6a32aead70a\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">40f7f5c</a>)</li>\n<li>use new image for keycloak go script + add devspace (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/0a9a9262e636e1d02442935087560ceb9087b650\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">0a9a926</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"121-2026-06-14\"><a href=\"#121-2026-06-14\"><a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/compare/v1.2.0...v1.2.1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">1.2.1</a> (2026-06-14)</a></h2>\n<h3 id=\"bug-fixes-3\"><a href=\"#bug-fixes-3\">Bug Fixes</a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>add the missing -local suffix to local build action (why is it not using the common one ??) (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/e4d486e5ab55eb514f5230e74705e2cc361fe6e9\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">e4d486e</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"120-2026-06-14\"><a href=\"#120-2026-06-14\"><a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/compare/v1.1.2...v1.2.0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">1.2.0</a> (2026-06-14)</a></h2>\n<h3 id=\"features-1\"><a href=\"#features-1\">Features</a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>allow manual triggering of CI jobs (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/b36a04f3bf7237e67672e9ab62bbe8a18133890c\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">b36a04f</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"bug-fixes-4\"><a href=\"#bug-fixes-4\">Bug Fixes</a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>release-please:</strong> do not include component in tag (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/a17cd1e2416c09d49de3652625f849ac4cefe762\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">a17cd1e</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"documentation\"><a href=\"#documentation\">Documentation</a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>write changelogs for past versions (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/cb90f68cec7d38d5e49b0a2fcc02e89dc68f18d3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">cb90f68</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"112-2026-06-09\"><a href=\"#112-2026-06-09\"><a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/releases/tag/v1.1.2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">1.1.2</a> (2026-06-09)</a></h2>\n<h3 id=\"features-2\"><a href=\"#features-2\">Features</a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>implement release-please for versioning and releases (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/35bf3bdd243ba2da4703a913481f002a6a66564e\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">35bf3bd</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"documentation-1\"><a href=\"#documentation-1\">Documentation</a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>fix release-please changelog list (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/725a56171f9c126b1c3432239563042209960aea\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">725a561</a>)</li>\n<li>update readme (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/17604f74e02dc70324dd53a3585aab9c7636c214\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">17604f7</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"111-2026-05-12\"><a href=\"#111-2026-05-12\">1.1.1 (2026-05-12)</a></h2>\n<h3 id=\"features-3\"><a href=\"#features-3\">Features</a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>add docker image publishing to GitHub Actions (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/5eb7913a54ca9e13cccd9506ef4ffb444f075cd9\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">5eb7913</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"bug-fixes-5\"><a href=\"#bug-fixes-5\">Bug Fixes</a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>pin urllib3 and click versions (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/a7aafe7c72424e5107c8b30442b5e3ceaf759cb4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">a7aafe7</a>)</li>\n<li>remove vulnerable and unneeded packages (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/85b6a168ed2b3f860f4a0c942cb0b6e4a052d0c8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">85b6a16</a>)</li>\n<li>use ubuntu-latest instead of arc-runner-set (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/d2c414bd96dade75c8955a8d2db84a16b154edf9\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">d2c414b</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"110-2026-05-12\"><a href=\"#110-2026-05-12\">1.1.0 (2026-05-12)</a></h2>\n<h3 id=\"bug-fixes-6\"><a href=\"#bug-fixes-6\">Bug Fixes</a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>temporarily switch from arc-runner-set to ubuntu-latest (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/f184554933e1a3882457ae658fc402c43d96e1f0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">f184554</a>)</li>\n<li>update version tool in deps and add lockfile version update (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/46aa1c6641434a48f4d44138a75648aaaee01dae\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">46aa1c6</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"103-2026-04-29\"><a href=\"#103-2026-04-29\">1.0.3 (2026-04-29)</a></h2>\n<h3 id=\"bug-fixes-7\"><a href=\"#bug-fixes-7\">Bug Fixes</a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>change delimiter to '+' instead of '-' (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/2b0f867e838f0ca3e05af752388b51f2d3001304\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">2b0f867</a>)</li>\n<li>change poetry to install bump-my-version instead of bump2version (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/c8cfd6461d43a3cfae47beb237ab26c70f7d2681\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">c8cfd64</a>)</li>\n<li>rename version release to build (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/2daa58cc26a57da983b5e8c743ab2707f5a0eb33\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">2daa58c</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"documentation-2\"><a href=\"#documentation-2\">Documentation</a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>fix readme example (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/fc507c94ce48dc63731033772107e96ce1749f22\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">fc507c9</a>)</li>\n<li>README versioning example changed to a more obvious effect (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/bc9669c7b062bc4d4424ef024f5a6ccb1d9101eb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">bc9669c</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"102-2026-04-29\"><a href=\"#102-2026-04-29\">1.0.2 (2026-04-29)</a></h2>\n<h3 id=\"bug-fixes-8\"><a href=\"#bug-fixes-8\">Bug Fixes</a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>docker build (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/8cbe52e647e8c5ac41c68804f42a9dbb8cab9805\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">8cbe52e</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"101-2026-04-12\"><a href=\"#101-2026-04-12\">1.0.1 (2026-04-12)</a></h2>\n<h3 id=\"documentation-3\"><a href=\"#documentation-3\">Documentation</a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>update docs link for matrix description (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/05a74b1b71854f6361bc593f4bc7a8be580ebc94\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">05a74b1</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"100-2026-04-11\"><a href=\"#100-2026-04-11\">1.0.0 (2026-04-11)</a></h2>\n<p>Initial release.</p>\n<h3 id=\"features-4\"><a href=\"#features-4\">Features</a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Matrix/Synapse RASENMAEHER integration API, replacing the template's fake product (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/ebe952e0c08e2ab1a60c8e509a39951ac11a6997\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ebe952e</a>)</li>\n<li>user CRUD against an auto-created space and rooms via a bot user, with tests (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/d66cfb8885fc34d32f666296e658c2718fa934b4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">d66cfb8</a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/85f7a5c828c68096d0a9952a213e53be820eb3d7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">85f7a5c</a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/c8d5bec2fc781f10cafff8b1dc0c9ff560c9976b\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">c8d5bec</a>)</li>\n<li>let regular users start video calls in rooms and create rooms in autogen-space (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/be1a46e4bdc41f331355adb19c7bc6f2f0305146\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">be1a46e</a>)</li>\n<li>call kc init scripts on container start (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/f7e8a8e56bd2a5e8fbb25dfeb84c4b7a3d547faa\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">f7e8a8e</a>)</li>\n<li>web UI with onboarding and feature guides (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/c768601d4810b62145808af4faf7b39dd9aac389\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">c768601</a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/1dbbaefcd6330b2ce6e8899c5657ef6360bef3cc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">1dbbaef</a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/298f4a951cdbfd643c1c77d4a1e23fa41c882ed7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">298f4a9</a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/77d2f1283c6bba922814151e7ebe93d79c138215\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">77d2f12</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"bug-fixes-9\"><a href=\"#bug-fixes-9\">Bug Fixes</a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>add missing tox config (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/3f5980e6f4fd002fe81153dcf1c58e14e064bd53\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">3f5980e</a>)</li>\n<li>container-init fixes (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/c7bfeae6de69d03a0340d75d3cd4be11cbd933a9\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">c7bfeae</a>)</li>\n<li>correct package author metadata (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/78e6d7baffbe40a8313251010e847864ae8bf1c3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">78e6d7b</a>)</li>\n<li>fail if secret unset, better pending_promotions, less noise (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/bae2fa57caf531df22874846650ea3fd034b5de5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">bae2fa5</a>)</li>\n<li>healthcheck error (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/d198af204b41e5d49e062f2546faa36a141877ca\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">d198af2</a>)</li>\n<li>onboarding loading (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/2b2413aa7074df1f1a5de020e81d6b37e9bd518a\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">2b2413a</a>)</li>\n<li>prevent race condition in init script (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/af656c62a120883ea0cbe863e01701351c6acce0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">af656c6</a>)</li>\n<li>remove https from mtls url (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/13cc26a4e760a0a656f7af8b2b58a2af7463362b\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">13cc26a</a>)</li>\n<li>use correct action versions, drop old custom action (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/af71db014954d74f15585e93a8b8bed62e6aa1a1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">af71db0</a>)</li>\n</ul>"
}
